{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":203,"count":28,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L03-2-07\",\"东西\",\"東西\",\"东西\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你要買什麼東西？","pinyin":"Nǐ yào mǎi shénme dōngxi?","english":"What stuff are you going to buy?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-07","sourceFront":"東西","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"很可愛，友美喜歡可愛的東西。","pinyin":"Hěn kěài. Yǒuměi xǐhuān kěài de dōngxi.","english":"It’s very cute. Youmei likes cute stuff.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這些東西一共多少錢？","pinyin":"Zhèxiē dōngxi yígòng duōshǎo qián?","english":"How much do these things cost altogether?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-16","sourceFront":"多少","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這些東西一共兩萬三千五百零五塊。","pinyin":"Zhèxiē dōngxi yígòng liǎng wàn sān qiān wǔ bǎi líng wǔ kuài.","english":"These stuff cost twenty three thousand, five hundred and five dollars in total.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-20","sourceFront":"零","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家商店的東西很便宜。","pinyin":"Zhè jiā shāngdiàn de dōngxi hěn piányi.","english":"Stuff in this store is quite cheap.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-3-05","sourceFront":"店/商店","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"咖啡、茶，我都喜歡。我也很餓，想吃一點兒東西。","pinyin":"Kāfēi, chá, wǒ dōu xǐhuān. Wǒ yě hěn è, xiǎng chī yìdiǎnr dōngxi.","english":"Coffee and tea, I like them both. I am also hungry; I would like to have some food.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"聽說這個牌子的東西很貴，可是很多人喜歡。","pinyin":"Tīngshuō zhè ge páizi de dōngxi hěn guì, kěshì hěn duō rén xǐhuān.","english":"I heard that this clothing brand is very expensive, but a lot of people like it.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我覺得有的舊東西很不錯，有的新東西也很有趣，我很喜歡看新車、新衣服，可是因為我的錢不多，所以我不常買。","pinyin":"Wǒ juéde yǒude jiù dōngxi hěn búcuò, yǒude xīn dōngxi yě hěn yǒuqù, wǒ hěn xǐhuān kàn xīn chē, xīn yīfu, kěshì yīnwèi wǒ de qián bù duō, suǒyǐ wǒ bù cháng mǎi.","english":"I think some old stuff is good and some new ones are interesting. I like to check the new car, new clothes out, but I do not have much money, so I don’t buy them often.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"是因為吃的東西不乾淨嗎？","pinyin":"Shì yīnwèi chī de dōngxi bù gānjìng ma?","english":"Is it because of having contaminated food?","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L03-2-12\",\"便宜\",\"便宜\",\"便宜\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A：這種蛋糕很貴嗎？ B：是啊，這種蛋糕不便宜。","pinyin":"A: Zhè zhǒng dàngāo hěn guì ma? B: Shì ā, zhè zhǒng dàngāo bù piányí.","english":"A: Is this kind of cake expensive? B: Yes, this kind of cake is not cheap.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-12","sourceFront":"便宜","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"五十塊錢很便宜！妳看，哪個顏色漂亮？","pinyin":"Wǔshí kuài qián hěn piányí! Nǐ kàn, nǎ ge yánsè piàoliang?","english":"It is inexpensive! Look, which color is better?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這家商店的東西很便宜。","pinyin":"Zhè jiā shāngdiàn de dōngxi hěn piányi.","english":"Stuff in this store is quite cheap.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-3-05","sourceFront":"店/商店","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這枝筆太貴了，你買便宜的吧。","pinyin":"Zhè zhī bǐ tài guì le, nǐ mǎi piányi de ba.","english":"This pen is too expensive, you had better buy a cheaper one.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-14","sourceFront":"吧","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家餐廳人太多，我們去那家餐廳，好嗎？他們的牛肉麵很好吃，也很便宜。","pinyin":"Zhè jiā cāntīng rén tài duō. Wǒmen qù nà jiā cāntīng, hǎo ma? Tāmen de niúròu miàn hěn hǎochī, yě hěn piányi.","english":"There are too many people in this restaurant. How about that restaurant? They have delicious beef noodles, and it is also cheap.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一共兩百多塊錢，好便宜！","pinyin":"Yígòng liǎng bǎi duō kuài qián, hǎo piányi!","english":"It is only a little over 200. It is cheap!","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"便(convenient) + 宜(suitable) → a price convenient and suitable for your wallet: cheap."},{"key":"[\"B1L07-1-06\",\"韓國\",\"韓國\",\"韩国\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"元真，我們明天幾點去找妳的韓國朋友？","pinyin":"Yuánzhēn, wǒmen míngtiān jǐ diǎn qù zhǎo nǐ de Hánguó péngyǒu?","english":"Yuanzhen, what time are we going to meet up with your Korean friends tomorrow?","sourceCardId":"B1L07-1-01","sourceFront":"怎麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"韓(the name Korea) + 國(country) → 韓國(Korea)."},{"key":"[\"B1L07-3-07\",\"車站\",\"車站\",\"车站\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在這個大車站，坐公車、捷運、火車都很方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-07","sourceFront":"車站","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我爸爸本來在車站旁邊有一塊地，後來他把那塊地賣了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-24","sourceFront":"地","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"山本良介要從台北車站搭捷運回去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-2-09","sourceFront":"回去","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這附近有捷運站和公車站，交通很便利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-21","sourceFront":"便利","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我在公車站等了一會兒，公車就來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-33","sourceFront":"一會兒","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我到公車站的時候，剛好有一班公車來了，要不然上班就遲到了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-08","sourceFront":"要不然","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為我趕時間，所以得搭計程車去車站。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-14","sourceFront":"趕","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我在車站遇到以前的同事，他現在是一家保險公司的經理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-02","sourceFront":"遇到","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我住的地方不算偏僻，但是附近沒有公車站，所以自行車成了我最常利用的交通工具。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-20","sourceFront":"成","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"週末的時候，火車站的賣票窗口總是排滿了人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-32","sourceFront":"窗口","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，上網訂好火車票後，可選擇到車站或便利商店取票。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-21","sourceFront":"取","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"行動不方便的乘客乘車時，車站有服務員為他們服務。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-03","sourceFront":"乘客","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"車(vehicle) + 站(station) → where vehicles stop: 車站(bus or rail station)."},{"key":"[\"B1L08-2-20\",\"楼梯\",\"樓梯\",\"楼梯\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我要坐電梯，不要走樓梯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-20","sourceFront":"樓梯","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"為了避免兒童發生意外，家長在樓梯邊裝了安全網。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-25","sourceFront":"網","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公寓的電梯修復中，請大家改走樓梯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-21","sourceFront":"修復","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-37\",\"滿意\",\"滿意\",\"满意\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"老師很滿意大家這次期中考的成績。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-37","sourceFront":"滿意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這次期中考，大家都考得很好，老師覺得很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-37","sourceFront":"滿意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"老闆很滿意小陳的工作表現， 明年要請他當經理呢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-24","sourceFront":"表現","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小簡向很多公司自我推薦，經過了幾個月，最後找到了滿意的工作","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-14","sourceFront":"經過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-04","sourceFront":"行程","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-04","sourceFront":"歌仔戲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"透過教授的介紹，我一畢業就順利地找到了滿意的工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-02","sourceFront":"透過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣的芒果冰好吃得沒話說，連吃過的外國人也十分滿意","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-41","sourceFront":"沒話說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:我到底該怎麼做才能讓老闆滿意？ B:你太驕傲、個性太急， 做事也不夠仔細。總之， 先把自己的缺點改掉吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-28","sourceFront":"總之","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天客人跟著小溫去參觀工廠，也試用了新產品，一切安排都令他十分滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-24","sourceFront":"一切","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師不滿意我們這一組的報告，要我們重做一次。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-55","sourceFront":"重","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-2-21\",\"饱\