sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我小時候最棒的休閒活動是到爺爺的菜園挖地種菜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-13","sourceFront":"挖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 休(rest) and 閒(leisure): 休閒 means leisure time."},{"key":"[\"B3L07-1-15\",\"难忘\",\"難忘\",\"难忘\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個我覺得最難忘的回憶應該是跟「第一次」相關的經驗，比如第一次戀愛、第一次當背包客等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-15","sourceFront":"難忘","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那個外國人第一次來臺灣就碰上了大地震，讓他非常難忘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-14","sourceFront":"碰上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L08-2-02\",\"时尚\",\"時尚\",\"时尚\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我認為多看時尚雜誌、多看模特兒怎麼穿衣服，應該就能使自己的穿著更有品味。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-17","sourceFront":"使","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"A:「快時尚」的服裝只有剛出來的頭幾個月受歡迎。 B:哦？你的意思是「快時尚」的衣服很快就失去魅力了嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-04","sourceFront":"哦","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了符合市場的需求，「快時尚」公司不斷地設計出最流行的服裝樣式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-19","sourceFront":"符合","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"快時尚的概念，就是在短時間內提供各式各樣的流行商品，讓顧客有更多更好的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-21","sourceFront":"概念","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L09-2-14\",\"滿\",\"滿\",\"满\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"張經理今天的工作行程安排得很滿，連吃飯、休息的時間都沒有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-14","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"黃先生上班常遲到，也不認真工作，這樣的態度讓老闆很不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-21","sourceFront":"不滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId