sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在臺灣，孩子出生滿一個月的時候，有的父母會請客，慶祝孩子滿月。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-01","sourceFront":"滿月","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"錢老闆滿腦子都是工作，每天只想著怎麼讓公司成長得快一點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-26","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小簡向很多公司自我推薦，經過了幾個月，最後找到了滿意的工作","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-14","sourceFront":"經過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我住的房子不大，也沒有很多錢，可是家人都很愛我， 讓我覺得很幸福、很滿足。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-17","sourceFront":"滿足","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在你的國家，成年的孩子常跟父母住在一起，還是滿十八歲就搬出去了？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-11","sourceFront":"成年","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我有一個幸福美滿的家庭，父母都很愛我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-24","sourceFront":"家庭","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老闆很滿意小陳的工作表現， 明年要請他當經理呢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-24","sourceFront":"表現","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在這家餐廳吃飯，只要滿兩千塊，就送一盤水果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-11","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那個杯子裡裝滿了水。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-11","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家印尼餐廳常常客滿，你最好先打電話訂位。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-23","sourceFront":"訂位","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家餐廳的菜又便宜又好吃，所以假日常常客滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-08","sourceFront":"客滿","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老師很滿意大家這次期中考的成績。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-37","sourceFront":"滿意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這次期中考，大家都考得很好，老師覺得很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-37","sourceFront":"滿意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"透過教授的介紹，我一畢業就順利地找到了滿意的工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-02","sourceFront":"透過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我打工的餐廳一到週末就客滿，忙不過來的時候，連老闆的叔叔都得來幫忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-33","sourceFront":"忙不過來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母送我的結婚禮物很珍貴，包含了他們對我滿滿的祝福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-04","sourceFront":"包含","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店滿足了人們購物的需求，就是不出門，也可買到各式各樣的生活用品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-08","sourceFront":"可","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣的芒果冰好吃得沒話說，連吃過的外國人也十分滿意","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-41","sourceFront":"沒話說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:我到底該怎麼做才能讓老闆滿意？ B:你太驕傲、個性太急， 做事也不夠仔細。總之， 先把自己的缺點改掉吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-28","sourceFront":"總之","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天客人跟著小溫去參觀工廠，也試用了新產品，一切安排都令他十分滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-24","sourceFront":"一切","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"花蓮那幾家旅館的雙人客房都客滿了，我們還是訂民宿吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-30","sourceFront":"客房","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"週末的時候，火車站的賣票窗口總是排滿了人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-32","sourceFront":"窗口","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"按照商品目錄的說明，消費滿五百元可以打八五折。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId"