:2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那棟沒有主人的房屋充滿恐怖的傳說，一般人都不願意靠近。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-31","sourceFront":"恐怖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Water 氵(water) pours until it fills the container level to the brim → 滿(full)."},{"key":"[\"B3L10-2-10\",\"较\",\"較\",\"较\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我朋友最近比較忙，別的時間他沒有空。","pinyin":"Wǒ péngyǒu zuìjìn bǐjiào máng, biéde shíjiān tā méi yǒukòng.","english":"My friend is busier lately; he isn’t available at other times.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L14-1-37\",\"情人节\",\"情人節\",\"情人节\",\"Name\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"溫小姐在白色情人節那天，送給情人一盒巧克力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-01","sourceFront":"情人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這種巧克力是情人節最熱門的商品，總是一下子就賣光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-06","sourceFront":"熱門","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-28\",\"卫生\",\"衛生\",\"卫生\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在路邊的攤子享受小吃，得注意他們處理食物的方式衛不衛生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-28","sourceFront":"衛生","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這個牌子的衛生紙打八折，很多人搶著購買。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-21","sourceFront":"衛生紙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"家裡的衛生紙快用完了，下班回家時順便買幾卷吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-20","sourceFront":"卷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"今年學校的預算只夠修理宿舍的衛生設備，其他需要改善的只能等到明年了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-16","sourceFront":"預算","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-15\",\"路线\",\"路線\",\"路线\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"旅行團的行程及路線是公司及導遊決定的，不喜歡的話，就只能自助旅遊了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-15","sourceFront":"路線","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我的電腦無法上網，檢查之後才發現網路線沒有接著電腦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-04","sourceFront":"接","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L09-1-50\",\"條\",\"條\",\"条\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"妳看，這條黃色的褲子不錯吧？","pinyin":"Nǐ kàn, zhè tiáo huángsè de kùzi búcuò ba?","english":"Look! This pair of yellow pants is nice, isn’t it?","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"很好看。這條藍的也很漂亮，藍色是今年很流行的顏色。","pinyin":"Hěn hǎokàn. Zhè tiáo lán de yě hěn piàoliang, lánsè shì jīnnián hěn liúxíng de yánsè.","english":"It is. This pair of blue pants is beautiful too. Blue is a popular color of this year.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這兩條我都去穿穿看。","pinyin":"Zhè liǎng tiáo wǒ dōu qù chuānchuān kàn.","english":"I will try both on.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"元真，妳的這條裙子真好看，我很喜歡。","pinyin":"Yuánzhēn, nǐ de zhè tiáo qúnzi zhēn hǎokàn, wǒ hěn xǐhuān.","english":"Yuanzhen, your skirt is very beautiful; I like it very much.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我家附近有三條捷運線，一條紅的、一條綠的和一條藍的。","pinyin":"Wǒ jiā fùjìn yǒu sān tiáo jiéyùn xiàn, yì tiáo hóng de, yì tiáo lǜ de hé yì tiáo lán de.","english":"There are three MRT routes near my place; the red one, the green one and the blue one.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 亻(person) takes a light 攵(rap) to the 木(tree), stripping a branch → one 條(measure word for roads)."},{"key":"[\"B4L10-2-03\",\"传染病\",\"傳染病\",\"传染病\",\"N\"]"